   "rationale": "Autonomous analysis pipelines must retrieve instrument output through a documented, headless, programmatically addressable path linked to the command or execution identifiers used by the control interface; Abolhasani et al. (2026) flag proprietary, encrypted exports as an obstacle to autonomous operation."
